# Frontend Rules

- Use React + TypeScript.
- Put API calls under `src/api/`.
- Put API and domain interfaces under `src/types/`.
- Read the backend URL from environment configuration (`VITE_API_BASE_URL`).
- Keep page-level screens and reusable components in separate folders.
- Avoid `any`.
- Do not implement unrelated UI while completing a Jira task.
